{
	mod = "Web Server"
	description = "A Hono-style web server framework and demo app running inside Portal 2: Community Edition AngelScript.\n\nIncludes the map:\nmaps/minecraft.bsp\n\nTo play it from the console:\nmap minecraft\n\nIMPORTANT SETUP:\nLaunch the game with:\n-netconport 8080\n\nThis opens the Source remote console port used by the local bridge. Without it, the browser bridge cannot send requests into P2CE.\n\nFeatures:\n- Hono-like routing in AngelScript\n- Query parameters, cookies, sessions, and custom headers\n- Demo page served through http://localhost:8080\n\nWork in progress."
